WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.898
Freddy Fazbear, the animatronic singing bear and main mascot for

00:00:03.914 --> 00:00:07.070
Freddy Fazbear's Pizzeria was brought into existence in 1983.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:10.046
We know this from the year printed on the coins in the game Fight Nights at Freddy's: Help Wanted.

00:00:10.068 --> 00:00:14.282
The 1980s, the golden age of the pizza arcade.

00:00:14.346 --> 00:00:17.934
Kids all over America were flocking to Freddy Fazbear's Pizza, the only

00:00:17.972 --> 00:00:20.986
place where you can chow down on a mid slice of pepperoni and throw quarter

00:00:21.018 --> 00:00:22.607
after quarter into an 8-bit video game,

00:00:22.607 --> 00:00:24.062
Like Ms. Pac-Man.

00:00:24.062 --> 00:00:27.282
One such kid was a regular preteen, known only to us as Gabriel.

00:00:27.346 --> 00:00:30.246
Gabriel loved the pizza and the games, but what brought him back to

00:00:30.268 --> 00:00:33.282
Fazbear's Pizzeria was truly their animatronic mascots.

00:00:33.346 --> 00:00:34.710
State of the art - at the time.

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:38.634
They could sing, they could dance, they could, well, that was pretty much it.

00:00:38.672 --> 00:00:40.074
But Gabriel loved it.

00:00:40.192 --> 00:00:44.241
-[Vanessa] Welcome to Freddy's. Have you met them yet? 

00:00:44.241 --> 00:00:45.265
-[Mike] Met who?

00:00:46.845 --> 00:00:51.150
-[Vanessa] Foxy. Bonnie. Chica. And… Freddy.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:54.974
Bonnie, Chica, and Foxy were fan favorites, but Gabriel loved Freddy,

00:00:55.012 --> 00:00:57.754
The oversized animatronic bear with a black hat and bow tie.

00:00:57.802 --> 00:00:58.874
He admired Freddy.

00:00:58.922 --> 00:00:59.834
He loved Freddy.

00:00:59.882 --> 00:01:03.322
And it was a good thing he did, because after Gabriel's horrific murder,

00:01:03.386 --> 00:01:07.554
Gabriel became Freddy, a version of Freddy out for revenge, a Freddy that

00:01:07.592 --> 00:01:11.424
sliced up more than just pizzas, and a Freddy who had no problem saying

00:01:11.424 --> 00:01:13.140
Game over to your life.

00:01:13.563 --> 00:01:14.456
(Freddy Laughs)

00:01:15.112 --> 00:01:16.226
(Screams)

00:01:16.226 --> 00:01:22.128
♪ Metal Music ♪

00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:24.006
Welcome to Horror History.

00:01:24.256 --> 00:01:27.266
One of this year's most anticipated films is Five Nights at Freddy's.

00:01:27.298 --> 00:01:30.930
Based on the popular video game and media empire created by Scott Cawthon.

00:01:31.010 --> 00:01:34.374
Cawthon wrote the film and has been the creative lead behind the FNaF games,

00:01:34.422 --> 00:01:38.438
sequels, spin offs, novels, guidebooks, and the rest of the Fazbear empire.

00:01:38.534 --> 00:01:42.086
The Freddy mascot from the Five Nights at Freddy's universe ironically became

00:01:42.118 --> 00:01:44.394
the mascot for the entire multimedia franchise.

00:01:44.442 --> 00:01:47.726
And although he has delivered some memorable scares, I wouldn't call him the

00:01:47.748 --> 00:01:49.418
main antagonist of the series.

00:01:49.514 --> 00:01:53.386
In order to fully understand how a creepy robot from a decade past became

00:01:53.418 --> 00:01:56.786
one of the most feared supernaturally possessed horror gaming icons,

00:01:56.808 --> 00:01:59.554
we have to dig deep into the history of Fazbear Entertainment, Inc.

00:01:59.592 --> 00:02:03.010
And its original owners, William Afton and Henry Emily.

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:03.994
(Impact)

00:02:08.151 --> 00:02:10.848
The evil begins as it does in many stories.

00:02:10.848 --> 00:02:11.878
With a British person.

00:02:11.964 --> 00:02:15.794
William Afton, the co-founder of Fazbear's Pizzeria and Gabriel's eventual killer,

00:02:15.842 --> 00:02:19.058
Was a calm, sophisticated brit hiding an array of psychopathic tendencies. 

00:02:19.074 --> 00:02:22.538
He's seen as a manipulative and focused businessman with the

00:02:22.544 --> 00:02:24.630
goal of building a pizza franchise empire.

00:02:24.710 --> 00:02:29.158
Sometime in the early 1970s, William Afton created Afton Robotics, LLC.

00:02:29.254 --> 00:02:32.966
This would soon combine with his interest in entertainment dining facilities.

00:02:33.078 --> 00:02:37.594
In the late 1970s, William Afton met another entrepreneur named Henry Emily,

00:02:37.642 --> 00:02:40.634
and the two collaborated to form their first entertainment dining facility

00:02:40.682 --> 00:02:43.612
aimed at children called Fredbear's Family Diner.

00:02:43.612 --> 00:02:46.778
This original diner was much more reminiscent of the establishment's

00:02:46.804 --> 00:02:49.666
Chuck E. Cheese and Showbiz Pizza, which was a direct rival to Chuck E. Cheese.

00:02:49.688 --> 00:02:53.474
In my Horror History episode on Charles Entertainment Cheese,

00:02:53.512 --> 00:02:56.626
it was noted that around this time period in the early 1980s,

00:02:56.648 --> 00:02:59.826
Chuck E. Cheese wasn't doing well, and many knockoff children's entertainment diners

00:02:59.858 --> 00:03:02.726
were popping up, mimicking the layout of their restaurants and using their

00:03:02.748 --> 00:03:05.526
own band of anthropomorphized animals who sing and perform.

00:03:05.628 --> 00:03:08.834
Showbiz Pizza and Fredbear's Family Diner were two such ripoffs.

00:03:08.882 --> 00:03:11.474
But where Showbiz Pizza would fade into obscurity,

00:03:11.474 --> 00:03:14.758
Fredbear's Family Diner would gain a far more insidious reputation.

00:03:14.854 --> 00:03:17.766
Where Charles found himself in the seedy underbelly of children's entertainment. 

00:03:17.798 --> 00:03:21.206
With drugs, gambling debt, and Internet hoaxes,

00:03:21.238 --> 00:03:24.666
Freddy Fazbear gets into an even more demented world of children's entertainment.

00:03:24.778 --> 00:03:27.914
This restaurant centered around Fred Bear and a yellow rabbit character

00:03:27.962 --> 00:03:29.002
named Spring Bonnie.

00:03:29.066 --> 00:03:31.962
Fred Bear was, in a sense, the original Freddy Fazbear.

00:03:32.026 --> 00:03:35.294
However, he would go on to take a whole new form after Fredbear's Family Diner

00:03:35.332 --> 00:03:38.542
Went out of business under mysterious circumstances.

00:03:38.686 --> 00:03:42.706
-[Instructional Voice] I think the name of the place was Fredbear's Family Diner or something like that.

00:03:42.728 --> 00:03:45.442
-[Instructional Voice] They're closed for years, though I doubt we'll be able to

00:03:45.496 --> 00:03:46.258
-[Instructional Voice] track anybody down.

00:03:46.344 --> 00:03:50.326
As time goes on, Fred Bear and Spring Bonnie would gain new friends

00:03:50.348 --> 00:03:53.473
Chica, the backup singer chicken, and Foxy, the pirate, who,

00:03:53.473 --> 00:03:55.378
if you haven't figured it out yet, is a fox.

00:03:55.474 --> 00:03:58.166
All of these characters look like they really could have participated in the

00:03:58.188 --> 00:04:00.054
robot pizza wars of the 1980s.

00:04:00.092 --> 00:04:04.294
In 1983, it's believed that William Afton's oldest son killed his youngest

00:04:04.342 --> 00:04:07.450
by holding him up to the mouth of the Freddy Fazbear animatronics face.

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:10.342
The little boy who was scared of Freddy was crying in fear.

00:04:10.406 --> 00:04:13.730
His tears caused the spring lock mechanism to malfunction and

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:16.190
Freddy's mouth to bite down on the boy's head, crushing it.

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:19.726
This tragedy, or one like it, is the cause of Afton's murderous and

00:04:19.748 --> 00:04:21.018
psychopathic tendencies.

00:04:21.114 --> 00:04:25.166
Under that corporate facade lies an egotistical sadist who doesn't just want

00:04:25.188 --> 00:04:28.334
to kill his victims, but designs their deaths to ensure that they physically

00:04:28.382 --> 00:04:29.314
suffer first.

00:04:29.432 --> 00:04:30.734
It's not about the killing.

00:04:30.782 --> 00:04:32.674
It's about causing pain in others.

00:04:32.792 --> 00:04:36.834
Where the sadism comes from is up for debate, but many FNaF scholars believe

00:04:36.872 --> 00:04:39.718
that Afton was irreparably changed from the loss of his son.

00:04:39.804 --> 00:04:43.014
Fredbear's Family Diner only stayed open for a few years after this incident,

00:04:43.052 --> 00:04:46.466
But just long enough for William Afton to kill his first known victim,

00:04:46.498 --> 00:04:49.986
Charlotte Emily, the daughter of Fredbear Family Diner’s co-owner,

00:04:50.018 --> 00:04:50.834
Henry Emily.

00:04:50.962 --> 00:04:54.218
But this is where the first puppet is possessed, as Charlotte possesses a

00:04:54.224 --> 00:04:56.650
puppet that had been programmed by her father to protect her.

00:04:56.720 --> 00:04:59.674
Although this would all lead to the closure of the original Fredbear Family Diner,

00:04:59.712 --> 00:05:03.110
This wouldn't be the end of the company or the iconic character.

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:06.398
Freddy would evolve and take on many different variations and forms,

00:05:06.404 --> 00:05:08.106
Which I'll discuss more at the end of this lesson.

00:05:08.138 --> 00:05:12.706
But for the sake of our timeline, let's just focus on the two main forms Classic Freddy, and Withered Freddy.

00:05:12.706 --> 00:05:14.554
As the original Fredbear's Family Diner closed,

00:05:14.602 --> 00:05:17.843
The original Freddy mascot was stored in the back of a new restaurant,

00:05:17.843 --> 00:05:21.151
Freddy Fazbear's Pizza, where he would be known, as Withered Freddy.

00:05:21.151 --> 00:05:23.742
The new restaurant was off to an actually okay start

00:05:23.742 --> 00:05:26.999
Until William Afton's sadistic side allowed itself to emerge,

00:05:29.392 --> 00:05:31.734
But William Afton's murderous tendencies didn't stop there, and soon,

00:05:31.772 --> 00:05:35.622
Gabriel and four other innocent children would become

00:05:35.676 --> 00:05:36.710
His next victims.

00:05:36.901 --> 00:05:39.627
(IMPACT)

00:05:41.701 --> 00:05:45.307
♪ Mysterious Music ♪

00:05:45.550 --> 00:05:49.366
Gabriel was a ten year old boy with bushy brown hair who visited

00:05:49.398 --> 00:05:51.498
Fredbear's Family Diner in June of 1985.

00:05:51.584 --> 00:05:54.726
It's heavily implied that the well behaved Gabriel was at the restaurant

00:05:54.758 --> 00:05:57.322
slash arcade to celebrate one of his friend's birthdays.

00:05:57.386 --> 00:06:00.686
Little is known about Gabriel because at the end of the day,

00:06:00.708 --> 00:06:01.822
Gabriel could have been any ten year old.

00:06:01.876 --> 00:06:04.222
When Afton killed him, it wasn't because of who he was.

00:06:04.276 --> 00:06:06.362
It was about the act of hunting and killing him.

00:06:06.436 --> 00:06:11.406
On the night of June 26, 1985, Gabriel and his friends, Jeremy, Susie, Fritz and Cassidy

00:06:11.438 --> 00:06:14.622
Were approached by one of the restaurant's big, goofy mascots-

00:06:14.686 --> 00:06:15.454
Spring Bonnie.

00:06:15.502 --> 00:06:18.926
What they didn't know is that inside the Spring Bonnie costume was

00:06:18.958 --> 00:06:21.570
William Afton, and he was luring them into a trap.

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:23.954
Afton invited the group of kids into the back rooms.

00:06:24.002 --> 00:06:25.794
No, not those back rooms.

00:06:25.842 --> 00:06:27.202
The back rooms of the pizzeria.

00:06:27.266 --> 00:06:30.418
And the five children found themselves in a darkened room alone with the

00:06:30.444 --> 00:06:31.494
British pizza mogul.

00:06:31.542 --> 00:06:35.286
Afton shut the door behind them and pulled out a knife, his weapon of choice.

00:06:35.286 --> 00:06:39.186
In short order, Afton had stabbed and murdered five innocent children.

00:06:39.186 --> 00:06:40.822
-[Vanessa] Some kids went missing.

00:06:40.886 --> 00:06:42.640
-[Vanessa] That's why the place shut down.

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:45.902
-[Vanessa] The police searched Freddy's 

00:06:46.036 --> 00:06:47.600
-[Vanessa] They never found the kids.

00:06:48.690 --> 00:06:52.266
Attempting to cover up his crimes, he stuffed their bodies into the empty

00:06:52.298 --> 00:06:55.818
space inside the very same animatronics that the kids came to

00:06:55.834 --> 00:06:57.022
Fredbear's Family Diner to admire.

00:06:57.086 --> 00:07:00.274
Inside the Freddy Fazbear animatronic, the restaurant's headliner and mascot,

00:07:00.312 --> 00:07:02.590
He shoved the body of little Gabriel.

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:06.125
The next morning, Afton told police that no one was allowed to touch the animatronics,

00:07:06.125 --> 00:07:08.994
So their bodies were never found, despite customer complaints of

00:07:09.042 --> 00:07:11.778
Smells, mucus, and blood throughout the restaurant.

00:07:11.874 --> 00:07:15.298
While Afton avoided criminal prosecution for these murders, eventually known

00:07:15.314 --> 00:07:18.566
as the Missing Children Incident, people began to suspect that he was

00:07:18.588 --> 00:07:21.622
somehow involved in the kid's disappearance, and the pizzeria's business

00:07:21.676 --> 00:07:22.482
began to suffer.

00:07:22.546 --> 00:07:24.826
But that turned out to be the least of his problems.

00:07:24.928 --> 00:07:27.846
The souls of the children that Afton had killed lingered in the mascot suits,

00:07:27.878 --> 00:07:31.306
And instead of moving on to the afterlife, they stayed on earth and

00:07:31.328 --> 00:07:34.018
eventually learned how to control the same animatronics that their bodies

00:07:34.054 --> 00:07:35.006
had been stuffed into.

00:07:35.108 --> 00:07:38.558
When Gabriel was alive, he was a mild mannered, polite child,

00:07:38.558 --> 00:07:41.354
But after his murder, he became vengeful and enraged.

00:07:41.482 --> 00:07:45.006
Once he learned how to control the Fazbear animatronic, Gabriel saw this

00:07:45.028 --> 00:07:48.466
newfound power as an avenue to get revenge on the man that killed him and

00:07:48.488 --> 00:07:50.786
hopefully then move on from the mortal world.

00:07:50.888 --> 00:07:54.638
Jeremy, Susie, Fritz, and Cassidy shared a similar goal with their ghosts

00:07:54.654 --> 00:07:58.807
inhabiting the other animal animatronics, Bonnie, Chica, Foxy and Golden Freddy.

00:07:59.532 --> 00:08:02.514
While it's not mentioned exactly what year Fredbear's Family Diner was shut down,

00:08:02.562 --> 00:08:05.650
It seems likely that it happened shortly after the murders.

00:08:05.730 --> 00:08:09.922
This does not stop Afton and now working on his own, he opens a new location

00:08:09.986 --> 00:08:13.866
in early November of 1987, going by the date on the paycheck you receive in

00:08:13.888 --> 00:08:15.178
Fight Nights at Freddy's 2.

00:08:15.264 --> 00:08:18.698
However, in this new location, Freddy is given a makeover and is back to

00:08:18.704 --> 00:08:21.114
looking like his classic self, along with the others.

00:08:21.232 --> 00:08:24.138
These new versions of Freddy and his friends used a different technology

00:08:24.224 --> 00:08:24.958
than the others.

00:08:25.044 --> 00:08:29.509
They were actually animatronic suits that had what was referred to as a spring lock mechanism,

00:08:29.509 --> 00:08:32.520
Allowing them to operate as both an animatronic and a bodysuit. 

00:08:32.520 --> 00:08:34.958
In animatronic mode, the characters could move on their own, but

00:08:34.964 --> 00:08:38.258
in bodysuit mode, the machinery would be pulled back, allowing a person to

00:08:38.264 --> 00:08:40.110
step inside and wear it like a costume.

00:08:40.190 --> 00:08:44.386
It is here in 1987 that the first incidents of Freddy Fazbear and the other

00:08:44.408 --> 00:08:47.346
possessed animatronics openly demonstrate an urge to kill.

00:08:47.448 --> 00:08:50.726
And even though their goal was to get revenge on William Afton as soon as nightfalls,

00:08:50.748 --> 00:08:53.926
They'll go after any adult in the building, which is usually the

00:08:53.948 --> 00:08:56.742
security guards who protect the Pizzeria during the off-hours.

00:08:56.876 --> 00:09:00.454
It's speculated that as lingering spirits, they can't differentiate one

00:09:00.492 --> 00:09:01.942
human from another all that well.

00:09:01.996 --> 00:09:04.986
They just see a tall man wearing the purple security guard uniform and

00:09:05.008 --> 00:09:08.138
associate that with William Afton, who was wearing purple at the time that

00:09:08.144 --> 00:09:09.050
he killed them.

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:11.529
-[Hiring Manager] They interact with the kids just fine,

00:09:11.529 --> 00:09:14.810
-[Hiring Manager] but when they encounter an adult, they just stare.

00:09:14.922 --> 00:09:18.126
Freddy Fazbear is the lead murder robot, taunting his victims and

00:09:18.148 --> 00:09:20.542
maliciously stalking them. Like Aston before him,

00:09:20.596 --> 00:09:24.560
Fazbear enjoys killing and shows his own streak of sadism as he does it.

00:09:24.814 --> 00:09:25.834
(Screams)

00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:29.374
As the new restaurant was open to thwart the bad reputation of the previous location,

00:09:29.422 --> 00:09:32.786
They put out an ad in the local paper to hire new nightguards and

00:09:32.808 --> 00:09:35.922
attempt to shift the public view of this new location as a positive thing,

00:09:35.976 --> 00:09:38.642
listing it as vintage Pizzeria given new life.

00:09:38.776 --> 00:09:41.846
Using the word vintage is particularly funny, considering that the other

00:09:41.868 --> 00:09:45.350
Pizzeria was only closed at the most, like, two years previous to this.

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:48.326
Anyway, we never learn who the first guard was to answer the ad, but we know

00:09:48.348 --> 00:09:51.302
that it did not take long before Freddy and company must have come for him,

00:09:51.356 --> 00:09:54.054
because he almost immediately requests to be moved to the day shift.

00:09:54.102 --> 00:09:58.036
According to the phone message left for his night shift replacement, Jeremy Fitzgerald,

00:09:58.036 --> 00:10:00.598
-[Hiring Manager] You're only the second guard to work at that location.

00:10:00.774 --> 00:10:04.962
-[Hiring Manager] The first guy finished his week but complained about conditions.

00:10:05.046 --> 00:10:08.618
The hiring manager also suggests a number of temporary solutions in dealing

00:10:08.634 --> 00:10:11.658
with the characters, one of which is for Jeremy to wear a Freddy Fazbear

00:10:11.674 --> 00:10:14.462
mask in order to confuse them, which initially throws them off.

00:10:14.516 --> 00:10:16.580
But even that only does so much.

00:10:17.910 --> 00:10:21.362
Afton and his company are able to keep Freddy's murders a secret for a while.

00:10:21.416 --> 00:10:24.333
But eventually, Freddy and others start attacking during the day. 

00:10:24.333 --> 00:10:27.809
The restaurant is closed, and somehow Jeremy isn't given this information 

00:10:27.809 --> 00:10:29.974
And is locked inside with Freddy and his friends

00:10:30.012 --> 00:10:30.726
For one last night.

00:10:30.828 --> 00:10:34.706
So after just a few weeks, Freddy Fazbear's Pizza is closed and the attacks

00:10:34.738 --> 00:10:37.314
are covered up as new animatronics malfunctioning.

00:10:37.362 --> 00:10:40.722
According to a story that the company had printed in the paper.

00:10:40.786 --> 00:10:44.133
This coverup works. A new location is opened in the early 1990s,

00:10:44.133 --> 00:10:46.598
And the crimes of the previous location seem to be buried.

00:10:46.694 --> 00:10:49.946
This time, the animatronics from the previous location are scrapped, and the

00:10:49.968 --> 00:10:52.725
originals from Fredbear's Family Diner are refurbished,

00:10:52.725 --> 00:10:54.374
Making Withered Freddy the new Freddy.

00:10:54.422 --> 00:10:57.998
It's never specified if Gabriel can possess multiple animatronic suits at one time,

00:10:58.004 --> 00:11:00.670
Or if it's just the one that his body was stuffed into.

00:11:00.740 --> 00:11:03.066
But either way, this new form of Freddy is out for revenge.

00:11:03.098 --> 00:11:05.626
Under what seems like Gabriel's influence.

00:11:05.626 --> 00:11:07.678
This time, Jeremy the nightguard does not return.

00:11:07.764 --> 00:11:09.342
This could be for several reasons.

00:11:09.406 --> 00:11:12.494
He may have been killed during his last shift, or he may have just realized

00:11:12.542 --> 00:11:16.258
that it wasn't worth risking his life for $20.10 of overtime pay.

00:11:16.344 --> 00:11:21.618
Even factoring in the inflation since 1987, that's the equivalent of $54.05

00:11:21.634 --> 00:11:22.566
in today's money.

00:11:22.668 --> 00:11:24.790
Whatever happened, Jeremy does not return.

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:27.782
And a nightguard by the name of Mike Schmidt starts the job in the early 1990s.

00:11:27.836 --> 00:11:32.114
We don't have an exact date for Mike's tenure, but based on inflation

00:11:32.162 --> 00:11:34.954
and what he receives as pay compared to what Jeremy got for the same

00:11:34.992 --> 00:11:37.034
position, early 90s seems to track.

00:11:37.152 --> 00:11:40.540
Mike is deliberately kept in the dark on Freddy in his past.

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:44.320
-[Hiring Manager] I wanted to record a message for you to help you

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:46.160
-[Hiring Manager] Get settled in on your first night.

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:49.566
-[Hiring Manager] I actually worked in that office before you.

00:11:49.668 --> 00:11:52.798
-[Hiring Manager] I'm finishing up my last week now, as a matter of fact.

00:11:52.884 --> 00:11:55.262
Once again, all training is done via voice message.

00:11:55.316 --> 00:11:57.726
And while the person on the phone does their best to try to hide the fact

00:11:57.748 --> 00:12:00.926
that Freddy has killed other guards, he does slip up here and there saying

00:12:00.948 --> 00:12:04.238
that he's surprised that Mike has made it this far on just the third night.

00:12:04.404 --> 00:12:06.534
-[Hiring Manager] Most people don't last this long...

00:12:06.572 --> 00:12:09.474
It seems this time, the company attempted to protect itself by installing secure

00:12:09.522 --> 00:12:12.262
steel doors that the guards could use to lock themselves into the office

00:12:12.316 --> 00:12:16.086
when they see Freddy, Chica, Bonnie or Foxy approaching, which offers a

00:12:16.108 --> 00:12:18.918
little more protection than just putting on a bear costume and hoping that

00:12:18.924 --> 00:12:20.118
they think that you're one of them.

00:12:20.204 --> 00:12:23.846
But the company has a limited electricity budget, meaning that Mike couldn't

00:12:23.878 --> 00:12:25.962
keep the protective doors armed the entire night.

00:12:26.016 --> 00:12:29.674
And it wouldn't be long before the roaming animatronics set their sights

00:12:29.712 --> 00:12:30.300
on him.

00:12:30.469 --> 00:12:33.086
(IMPACT)

00:12:35.372 --> 00:12:38.974
♪ Mysterious Music ♪

00:12:39.090 --> 00:12:42.682
Mike would do his best to monitor the activity going on in the restaurant

00:12:42.746 --> 00:12:44.666
during his Fight Nights at Freddy's.

00:12:44.698 --> 00:12:47.278
But Freddy and the others were good at sneaking past when the security

00:12:47.364 --> 00:12:50.574
cameras were looking elsewhere, along with the other guards before Mike.

00:12:50.622 --> 00:12:53.458
It seems as though Freddy killed whoever it is that is training him over the voicemails,

00:12:53.464 --> 00:12:56.034
Because in the middle of the last one, it cuts out.

00:12:56.072 --> 00:12:59.154
And what can be assumed is Freddy's demonic voice is heard mumbling gibberish

00:12:59.202 --> 00:13:01.238
Leaving Mike on his own.

00:13:01.404 --> 00:13:02.070
-[Hiring Manager] Hey. Wow.

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:02.950
-[Hiring Manager] Day four.

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:04.326
-[Hiring Manager] I knew you could do it.

00:13:04.428 --> 00:13:08.490
-[Hiring Manager] Hey, listen, I may not be around to send you a message tomorrow.

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:12.300
-[Hiring Manager] It's been a bad night here for me.

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:18.426
-[Hiring Manager] I'm kind of glad that I recorded my messages for you when I did.

00:13:18.608 --> 00:13:20.198
-[Hiring Manager] Hey, do me a favor.

00:13:20.384 --> 00:13:25.440
-[Hiring Manager] Maybe sometime you could check inside those suits in the back room.

00:13:25.810 --> 00:13:28.794
-[Hiring Manager] I'm going to try to hold out until someone checks.

00:13:28.922 --> 00:13:30.560
-[Hiring Manager] Maybe it won't be so bad.

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:36.349
-[Hiring Manager] I always wondered what was in all those empty heads back there, you know?

00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:38.975
-[Hiring Manager] Oh, no.

00:13:40.541 --> 00:13:41.041
(Demonic voice mumbling)

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:45.858
According to the check stubs, Mike did make it through one more night and

00:13:45.864 --> 00:13:49.494
was paid double his rate for overtime, which was only another $120.

00:13:49.612 --> 00:13:52.454
After this, the murdered children possessing the animatronics finally

00:13:52.492 --> 00:13:55.570
stopped targeting security guards long enough to go after their main target,

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:56.626
William Afton.

00:13:56.738 --> 00:14:00.270
In the mid-90s, William Afton returned to the dusty and shuddered

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:03.718
Freddy Fazbear's Pizza to dismantle his original animatronic creations.

00:14:03.814 --> 00:14:06.842
The children's ghost chased Afton into his safe room, where another,

00:14:06.896 --> 00:14:10.278
unpossessed animatronic, a Spring Bonnie, had been placed for storage.

00:14:10.374 --> 00:14:13.930
Fleeing the vengeful ghost, Afton jumped into the Spring Bonnie suit to hide.

00:14:14.010 --> 00:14:17.738
But over the years, the pizzeria building had decayed, and on that rainy night,

00:14:17.754 --> 00:14:19.162
leaks were plentiful.

00:14:19.226 --> 00:14:22.974
One of these leaks was right over the animatronic that Afton was hiding in,

00:14:23.012 --> 00:14:25.834
and soon enough, it shorted out its spring lock mechanism.

00:14:25.962 --> 00:14:29.506
According to these vintage instructional tapes uncovered in FNaF 3.

00:14:29.528 --> 00:14:33.006
A spring lock mechanism is a design inside of the animatronic suit that allows

00:14:33.038 --> 00:14:36.226
a user to pull a crank and lock the machine parts so that the wearer

00:14:36.248 --> 00:14:37.450
Won't be ripped apart by the gears.

00:14:37.550 --> 00:14:41.337
-[Instructional Voice] To change the animatronics to suit mode, insert and turn

00:14:41.337 --> 00:14:44.162
-[Instructional Voice] firmly the hand crank provided by the manufacturer.

00:14:44.306 --> 00:14:48.646
-[Instructional Voice] Turning the crank will recoil and compress the animatronic parts

00:14:48.668 --> 00:14:51.580
-[Instructional Voice] around the sides of the suit, providing room to climb inside.

00:14:52.110 --> 00:14:55.706
-[Instructional Voice] Please make sure the spring locks are fastened tight to ensure the

00:14:55.728 --> 00:14:57.878
-[Instructional Voice] animatronic devices remain fixed.

00:14:57.974 --> 00:15:01.614
And whoever created the instructional tapes seems very aware of what can

00:15:01.652 --> 00:15:03.818
happen if the instructions are not followed.

00:15:03.914 --> 00:15:08.190
-[Instructional Voice] Please pay close attention while learning how to operate these suits,

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:14.330
-[Instructional Voice] As accidents/ injuries/deaths/irreparable and grotesque maiming can occur.

00:15:14.410 --> 00:15:18.094
When Aston climbs into the suit, in an instant, the robot's gears sprung

00:15:18.142 --> 00:15:22.062
shut on his body, mutilating him and causing an extremely slow,

00:15:22.126 --> 00:15:23.294
Extremely painful death.

00:15:23.422 --> 00:15:26.658
Shortly after, the ghosts of the slain children, including Gabriel in the

00:15:26.664 --> 00:15:29.746
Freddy Fazbear animatronic, decided that they no longer needed to inhabit

00:15:29.778 --> 00:15:32.370
their robot bodies and moved on to the afterlife.

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:37.406
But the cycle of violence continued beyond just Gabriel's, inhabitation of Freddy Fazbear.

00:15:37.406 --> 00:15:40.086
For one, Afton came to possess the Spring Bonnie robot that his body was

00:15:40.108 --> 00:15:44.568
Now enclosed in and became known as Springtrap, another murderous animatronic.

00:15:44.568 --> 00:15:47.642
Once Gabriel had moved into the afterlife, Freddy himself took

00:15:47.696 --> 00:15:51.098
kind of a backseat and isn't heard from again until 30 years later.

00:15:51.184 --> 00:15:53.899
After the last Freddy Fazbear's Pizza had closed.

00:15:53.899 --> 00:15:57.946
In 2023, a horror attraction based on the restaurant's sordid history was opened

00:15:57.978 --> 00:16:00.330
Called Fazbear's Frights: The Horror Attraction.

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:03.178
Freddy is not heavily featured in this attraction, but a very withered

00:16:03.194 --> 00:16:05.322
version of Freddy sits outside of an office door.

00:16:05.386 --> 00:16:08.786
Shortly after this, Fazbear Entertainment puts out a VR game called the

00:16:08.808 --> 00:16:12.066
Freddy Fazbear Virtual Experience, where they embrace the idea that their

00:16:12.088 --> 00:16:14.766
once beloved mascot has turned into a horror icon.

00:16:14.878 --> 00:16:18.946
-[VR Game] And while it's true that some stories associated with our name were loosely

00:16:18.978 --> 00:16:23.766
-[VR Game] based on actual events, the majority of them were total fabrications from

00:16:23.788 --> 00:16:25.410
-[VR Game] the mind of a complete lunatic.

00:16:25.490 --> 00:16:26.482
-[VR Game] Lawsuits pending.

00:16:26.546 --> 00:16:28.676
-[VR Game] But we aren't above laughing at ourselves.

00:16:28.790 --> 00:16:30.243
-[VR Game] Ha ha ha.

00:16:30.497 --> 00:16:34.624
-[VR Game] That's why we have recreated many of these completely fictitious scenarios,

00:16:34.624 --> 00:16:39.226
-[VR Game] Lies! That you've been fed over the last several years

00:16:39.248 --> 00:16:40.650
-[VR Game] Into a hilarious VR game.

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:44.026
The virtual experience contains the in universe versions of FNaF 1-3,

00:16:44.048 --> 00:16:45.994
As well as some additional game modes.

00:16:46.042 --> 00:16:50.210
It's kind of like how the Stab movies are actual movies inside of the Scream franchise.

00:16:50.210 --> 00:16:52.346
Throughout the experience, it becomes evident that

00:16:52.378 --> 00:16:55.000
William Afton's soul is still out there, manifesting in the game

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:57.142
As a new villain known as Glitchtrap.

00:16:57.226 --> 00:17:00.146
The release of this game actually helped reinvigorate interest in the

00:17:00.168 --> 00:17:03.694
Fazbear brand by marketing the game as a horror experience to adults.

00:17:03.742 --> 00:17:06.786
They also reminded them how much they loved the Fazbear brand as kids, which

00:17:06.808 --> 00:17:09.942
helped generate interest in giving their own kids a similar experience.

00:17:10.076 --> 00:17:12.050
At least that's my take on the events.

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:15.298
Because it wasn't long before a new entertainment center called

00:17:15.314 --> 00:17:19.574
Freddy Fazbear's Pizza Megaplex is built, most likely in the mid to late 2020s.

00:17:19.612 --> 00:17:23.142
It seems to have evolved from Freddy Fazbear's Pizza almost 40 years earlier.

00:17:23.206 --> 00:17:26.474
It's kind of like a Discovery Zone or Disney Quest, basically a high end

00:17:26.512 --> 00:17:27.990
arcade play center hybrid.

00:17:28.070 --> 00:17:31.486
There's a new futuristic version of Freddy called Glamrock Freddy,

00:17:31.508 --> 00:17:34.746
Who doesn't seem to be possessed, but he does appear to be sentient.

00:17:34.938 --> 00:17:36.320
-[Glamrock Freddy] There you are.

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:38.858
-[Glamrock Freddy]How odd.

00:17:39.034 --> 00:17:43.557
-[Glamrock Freddy] Your guest profile is unknown to me. Who are you?

00:17:43.557 --> 00:17:47.091
A little boy named Gregory gets trapped in Freddy Fazbear's Mega Pizzaplex,

00:17:47.091 --> 00:17:49.346
But this time the security guard, a woman who goes by Vanessa,

00:17:49.368 --> 00:17:52.018
Is out to get Gregory and wants to kill him.

00:17:52.104 --> 00:17:55.666
This is because Vanessa is a follower of William Afton, whose soul still

00:17:55.688 --> 00:17:58.190
lingers around possessing various animatronics.

00:17:58.270 --> 00:18:01.462
This time, Freddy takes on a different role, as his goal is to protect

00:18:01.516 --> 00:18:04.438
Gregory from Vanessa and Afton and ensure that the little boy makes it

00:18:04.444 --> 00:18:05.078
through the night.

00:18:05.164 --> 00:18:07.846
There's also a new threat to worry about, known as The Tangle,

00:18:07.868 --> 00:18:11.110
An amalgamation of different animatronic parts with a fun time Freddy head.

00:18:11.180 --> 00:18:14.618
Although Glamrock Freddy seems to be more of a protagonist this time around,

00:18:14.704 --> 00:18:16.774
his overall role hasn't really changed.

00:18:16.822 --> 00:18:20.678
He was originally out to get revenge on William Afton and notoriously caused

00:18:20.694 --> 00:18:21.894
harm to security guards.

00:18:21.942 --> 00:18:24.358
So maybe Freddy is up to his usual antics.

00:18:24.454 --> 00:18:25.982
Depends on how you want to look at it.

00:18:26.036 --> 00:18:29.546
As a horror villain, it's in my opinion that Freddy Fazbear is, at its core,

00:18:29.578 --> 00:18:32.158
a lesson about the dangers of not letting go of the past.

00:18:32.244 --> 00:18:36.014
Gabriel as Freddy Fazbear is consumed with revenge for his murder, taking

00:18:36.052 --> 00:18:39.410
the lives of innocent nightguards, William Afton killed the missing children

00:18:39.480 --> 00:18:41.986
because he couldn't get over the trauma of losing his own family.

00:18:42.088 --> 00:18:45.458
If either of these characters had simply left past in the past,

00:18:45.464 --> 00:18:46.798
The cycle of violence could have stopped.

00:18:46.894 --> 00:18:50.518
Beyond that, the FNaF series itself is constantly looking back to the past.

00:18:50.604 --> 00:18:53.782
With 8-bit style mini games and a restaurant setting that was huge 40 years ago,

00:18:53.836 --> 00:18:57.526
It is most popular with an audience of now adults who get to see

00:18:57.548 --> 00:19:00.014
a spin on a familiar location from their childhoods.

00:19:00.082 --> 00:19:03.418
In Fight Nights at Freddy's 3, random nostalgia hunters try to raid the

00:19:03.424 --> 00:19:06.982
old pizzeria for animatronics, turning themselves into new victims.

00:19:07.046 --> 00:19:11.354
This concept is probably once again directly inspired by real life,

00:19:11.392 --> 00:19:14.766
Where urban explorers and animatronic archivists have raided old Chuck E. Cheeses,

00:19:14.788 --> 00:19:18.206
Showbiz Pizzas and other similar establishments to document and

00:19:18.228 --> 00:19:19.822
preserve these relics of the past.

00:19:19.956 --> 00:19:23.066
But the message that the franchise and the Freddy Fazbear character delivers,

00:19:23.098 --> 00:19:25.730
May not have even been an intentional one.

00:19:25.800 --> 00:19:28.994
At least, that's the conclusion I came to after looking into the past and

00:19:29.032 --> 00:19:32.050
into the mind of the game's original developer.

00:19:32.050 --> 00:19:34.050
(IMPACT)

00:19:36.992 --> 00:19:40.669
♪ Mysterious Music ♪

00:19:41.106 --> 00:19:44.486
It seems likely that the lesson about letting go of the past is likely a

00:19:44.508 --> 00:19:48.194
subconscious one accidentally delivered by the game's creator, Scott Cawthon.

00:19:48.242 --> 00:19:51.598
The 45 year old developer was also born at the perfect time to have spent

00:19:51.598 --> 00:19:54.634
his formative years in the establishments that Freddy Fazbear's Pizza is

00:19:54.672 --> 00:19:55.850
based on in the 80s.

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:59.626
Freddy Fazbear, more than anything else, is the copyright safe version of

00:19:59.648 --> 00:20:03.754
Billy Bob Brockali of the Rock-afire Explosion, the in house animatronic band

00:20:03.802 --> 00:20:07.246
seen in Showbiz Pizza restaurants from 1980 to 1992.

00:20:07.348 --> 00:20:10.375
Even just his acute knowledge of the Chuck E. Cheese knockoff,

00:20:10.375 --> 00:20:13.086
Showbiz Pizza demonstrates Cawthon's fascination with a

00:20:13.108 --> 00:20:15.198
specific screenshot of the 1980s.

00:20:15.284 --> 00:20:18.994
But intentional or not, the warning about holding on to the past couldn't be clearer.

00:20:19.032 --> 00:20:22.978
In the FNaF universe, revenge literally traps you, trapping you as a

00:20:22.984 --> 00:20:26.574
ghost here on Earth and as a demonic spirit inside an animatronic.

00:20:26.622 --> 00:20:30.518
It's only until your soul learns to let go that you find peace and move on.

00:20:30.604 --> 00:20:35.255
And if that never happens, well, you're doomed to continue your murder spree forever,

00:20:35.255 --> 00:20:38.134
Which seems to be the case for many in the FNaF-verse,

00:20:38.172 --> 00:20:42.162
Because Freddy's train of games, books, and now movies shows no sign of stopping.

00:20:42.226 --> 00:20:45.206
The theme of not being able to let go has even persisted in the games themselves.

00:20:45.238 --> 00:20:48.326
Scott Cawthon developed the first six main games in the series,

00:20:48.358 --> 00:20:52.426
which include FNaF 1-4, Sister Location, Pizzeria Simulator, and the spinoff,

00:20:52.448 --> 00:20:55.726
Ultimate Custom Knight, all of which have William Afton as the

00:20:55.748 --> 00:20:57.722
main overarching antagonist of the series.

00:20:57.786 --> 00:21:01.242
In 2019 Five Nights at Freddy's: Help Wanted was set to release.

00:21:01.306 --> 00:21:03.690
This time being developed by Steel Wool Studios.

00:21:03.770 --> 00:21:06.558
While this was originally just going to be a collection of VR ports of the original games,

00:21:06.564 --> 00:21:09.886
It ended up including a story of its own that mostly exists

00:21:09.918 --> 00:21:10.990
in the game's subtext.

00:21:11.070 --> 00:21:14.386
In Help Wanted, you play as a game tester, testing out the VR versions of

00:21:14.408 --> 00:21:17.646
the Five Nights at Freddy's games, which now exist in universe as the

00:21:17.678 --> 00:21:20.130
Freddy Fazbear Virtual Experience, which I mentioned earlier.

00:21:20.210 --> 00:21:23.334
But the games contained this glitch character named Glitchtrap, who most

00:21:23.372 --> 00:21:26.258
fans believed to be sort of a digital incarnation of Afton.

00:21:26.354 --> 00:21:29.382
At this point, a lot of fans felt that William Afton's story had been told

00:21:29.436 --> 00:21:32.966
and were hoping to see a new antagonist for this new era of FNaF,

00:21:32.998 --> 00:21:33.750
The Steel Wool era.

00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:35.546
But that's not what happened.

00:21:35.648 --> 00:21:38.954
Even the movie series seems to be holding on to the franchise's past rather

00:21:38.992 --> 00:21:40.630
than pushing forward into new territory.

00:21:40.710 --> 00:21:43.946
Scott Cawthon said that his script is based on Five Nights at Freddy's 1

00:21:43.968 --> 00:21:46.830
and that he hopes to turn the sequel games into their own movies as well.

00:21:46.900 --> 00:21:48.110
Not that that's a bad thing.

00:21:48.180 --> 00:21:51.226
The only reason I point it out is because it is a telling choice.

00:21:51.338 --> 00:21:54.240
This will be the third adaptation of that original story.

00:21:54.240 --> 00:21:57.874
In the movie canon, Mike Schmidt, the guard from the original Fight Nights at Freddy's,

00:21:57.912 --> 00:22:00.850
Gets hired as a nightguard and brings along his daughter during his shift.

00:22:00.850 --> 00:22:02.574
– [Mike] I will work, and you will sleep.

00:22:02.574 --> 00:22:03.074
– [Abby I understand.

00:22:06.070 --> 00:22:07.026
– [Mike] Give me your hand.

00:22:07.128 --> 00:22:10.454
It seems as if the movie canon will be separate from the game canon, 

00:22:10.492 --> 00:22:13.478
Because in the movie, the animatronics are targeting Schmidt's daughter,

00:22:13.484 --> 00:22:15.494
Trying to kill her and get her to become one of them.

00:22:15.612 --> 00:22:18.642
-[Mike] What do they want? 
-[Vanessa] They want to make her like them.

00:22:18.642 --> 00:22:19.306
-[Mike] Abby!

00:22:19.306 --> 00:22:22.486
While it seems that earlier iterations of Freddy or Gabriel were more set on

00:22:22.508 --> 00:22:25.878
protecting children, it does track that Gabriel looks to other children as a

00:22:25.884 --> 00:22:26.978
means of companionship.

00:22:27.074 --> 00:22:30.947
So that is my take on the very convoluted history of Freddy Fazbear. 

00:22:30.947 --> 00:22:33.486
And if this video came out on time, you guys will have received a

00:22:33.508 --> 00:22:36.782
Freddy Krueger episode and a Freddy Fazbear episode all in one month.

00:22:36.836 --> 00:22:39.774
So let me know if there are any other horror Freddy's that I can cover.

00:22:39.812 --> 00:22:40.766
Before we wrap this one up.

00:22:40.788 --> 00:22:43.546
It wouldn't feel right, not to mention a few of the other forms of Freddy Fazbear

00:22:43.578 --> 00:22:46.250
That I held off talking about for simplicity's sake.

00:22:46.330 --> 00:22:48.466
So just as there are many different forms of Chuck E. Cheese,

00:22:48.488 --> 00:22:52.382
Including the Pizza Time Theater era, the Tuxedo era,

00:22:52.446 --> 00:22:53.310
the Skater era, etc.

00:22:53.390 --> 00:22:55.743
There are also tons of alternate looks for Freddy.

00:22:55.743 --> 00:22:58.538
Five Nights at Freddy's 4 takes place in a child's bedroom,

00:22:58.538 --> 00:23:01.480
and the player is attacked by nightmare versions of the animatronics,

00:23:01.480 --> 00:23:04.082
one of which is the very terrifying Nightmare Fredbear.

00:23:04.146 --> 00:23:06.966
It's widely believed in the fandom that the child that you're playing as is

00:23:06.988 --> 00:23:08.518
William Afton's surviving son.

00:23:08.604 --> 00:23:11.598
Fight Nights at Freddy's 2 introduces many alternate forms, such as

00:23:11.634 --> 00:23:14.634
Toy Freddy and Shadow Freddy, which means we can only assume that while

00:23:14.672 --> 00:23:18.106
Gabriel's body was stuffed into one specific animatronic, he was able to

00:23:18.128 --> 00:23:20.086
somehow inhabit the other Freddy robots.

00:23:20.198 --> 00:23:23.962
The original five games all contain an alternate called Golden Freddy,

00:23:24.016 --> 00:23:25.150
Who very little is known about.

00:23:25.220 --> 00:23:28.078
He almost seems to be a cross between the old school Fredbear and the

00:23:28.084 --> 00:23:29.562
redesigned Freddy Fazbear.

00:23:29.626 --> 00:23:33.214
The fifth game, Fight Nights at Freddy's: Sister Location, gave us Yenndo,

00:23:33.252 --> 00:23:36.710
Short for yellow endoskeleton bear, a very Terminator-esque version of Freddy Fazbear.

00:23:36.730 --> 00:23:40.098
The last one I'll highlight is Phantom Freddy from Fight Nights at Freddy's 3.

00:23:40.104 --> 00:23:43.406
A burnt, partially destroyed character that somehow survived

00:23:43.438 --> 00:23:44.654
the 40 year time gap.

00:23:44.702 --> 00:23:47.854
The alternate forms are just another cool way that Fazbear Entertainment

00:23:47.902 --> 00:23:51.138
mirrored the unsettling evolutions of its real world counterparts.

00:23:51.234 --> 00:23:54.658
But if you want to fully understand the world of the 1980s robot pizza mascots

00:23:54.674 --> 00:23:57.458
That gave way to the creation of the Fight Nights at Freddy's franchise,

00:23:57.474 --> 00:24:00.450
You should check out my horror history on the rat himself,

00:24:00.530 --> 00:24:02.258
Charles Entertainment Cheese.

00:24:02.258 --> 00:24:02.758
Please! 

00:24:02.844 --> 00:24:04.150
It's probably my best video.

00:24:04.220 --> 00:24:06.802
I feel like it should have, like, at least four times more views.

00:24:06.866 --> 00:24:10.094
Remember to subscribe to CZsWorld for new horrors every week.

00:24:10.172 --> 00:24:14.030
Ring the Deathbell for all notifications, and I'll see you in the next one.

00:24:14.100 --> 00:24:16.270
Assuming we both survive.

